WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.771
- [Claire] I'm so
obsessed with it already.

00:00:02.771 --> 00:00:03.741
- Everyone at some point in

00:00:03.741 --> 00:00:05.469
their life thinks about getting a tattoo.

00:00:05.469 --> 00:00:07.047
I've thought about it five times.

00:00:07.047 --> 00:00:09.669
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:09.669 --> 00:00:11.097
Tattoos, I think are magical

00:00:11.097 --> 00:00:13.147
just something about 'em
that has the power to heal.

00:00:13.147 --> 00:00:15.376
Last year I got a tattoo
to memorialize my aunt

00:00:15.376 --> 00:00:16.298
who passed away,

00:00:16.298 --> 00:00:19.109
and it was one of the most
empowering moments of my life.

00:00:19.109 --> 00:00:21.359
So I want to share that
experience with other people.

00:00:21.359 --> 00:00:22.192
Which is why

00:00:22.192 --> 00:00:24.687
I'm on a mission to find other
people with powerful stories

00:00:24.687 --> 00:00:26.989
and hook them up with their dream tattoo.

00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:28.719
Welcome to First Ink.

00:00:28.719 --> 00:00:32.386
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:33.586 --> 00:00:36.149
I'm sure half of the people
in L.A. have tattoos.

00:00:36.149 --> 00:00:37.349
Henry, do you have a tattoo?

00:00:37.349 --> 00:00:38.182
- [Henry] No.

00:00:38.182 --> 00:00:39.125
- And what about the rest of you guys?

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:41.047
Who here has tattoos in the car?

00:00:41.047 --> 00:00:41.880
- I do.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:42.713
- [Ben] How many?

00:00:42.713 --> 00:00:43.546
- I have one.

00:00:43.546 --> 00:00:46.788
- We are driving from our
BuzzFeed campus in Hollywood,

00:00:46.788 --> 00:00:48.308
all the way to Santa Barbara,

00:00:48.308 --> 00:00:50.209
we're going to be meeting
Claire, who's a student,

00:00:50.209 --> 00:00:52.897
who's going to be getting
her first ink today.

00:00:52.897 --> 00:00:54.878
She has a very powerful story.

00:00:54.878 --> 00:00:57.718
It's pretty difficult subject matter,

00:00:57.718 --> 00:00:59.948
but I went through hundreds
of submissions for this.

00:00:59.948 --> 00:01:01.738
Claire stood out the most.

00:01:01.738 --> 00:01:04.158
We're gonna hear her story,
which is very compelling.

00:01:04.158 --> 00:01:05.802
We're going to find out about her tattoo,

00:01:05.802 --> 00:01:07.148
what she has in mind,

00:01:07.148 --> 00:01:11.169
and hook her up with some dope tattoo art.

00:01:11.169 --> 00:01:15.038
- It's kind of a story with
good things and bad things,

00:01:15.038 --> 00:01:15.998
and with this tattoo

00:01:15.998 --> 00:01:19.449
I'm trying to reflect the good
things that came out of it.

00:01:19.449 --> 00:01:21.668
Around January this year,

00:01:21.668 --> 00:01:25.118
I was sexually assaulted by my boss.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:27.769
I was out getting drinks with coworkers,

00:01:27.769 --> 00:01:30.609
he offered to walk me home,

00:01:30.609 --> 00:01:34.878
and the next thing I knew
we were in bed together,

00:01:34.878 --> 00:01:37.588
and he was taking off a used condom.

00:01:37.588 --> 00:01:41.755
When it first happened I was
really, really deep in denial.

00:01:42.598 --> 00:01:46.107
I was having anxiety
attacks, panic attacks,

00:01:46.107 --> 00:01:48.636
I was diagnosed with PTSD,

00:01:48.636 --> 00:01:50.766
and I was still going to work with him.

00:01:50.766 --> 00:01:53.594
It took me the longest
time to say it out loud,

00:01:53.594 --> 00:01:56.657
and say I was assaulted, I was raped.

00:01:56.657 --> 00:01:59.977
Having people there to tell
you, no, it's not your fault,

00:01:59.977 --> 00:02:00.810
helped me feel

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:03.876
a lot more comfortable
in telling other people.

00:02:03.876 --> 00:02:07.566
So I want this tattoo to
represent the people who were

00:02:07.566 --> 00:02:10.068
there for me when I needed them the most.

00:02:10.068 --> 00:02:12.255
- [Ben] So you're going to get
flowers to represent friends

00:02:12.255 --> 00:02:13.926
and family who supported you?

00:02:13.926 --> 00:02:14.846
- [Claire] Yeah.

00:02:14.846 --> 00:02:16.036
- This is my studio.

00:02:16.036 --> 00:02:17.228
I've been tattooing,

00:02:17.228 --> 00:02:20.148
well I did my first one
in like, 14 years ago.

00:02:20.148 --> 00:02:20.981
- Is that legal?

00:02:20.981 --> 00:02:22.676
- Na, Uh...

00:02:22.676 --> 00:02:26.625
My rebellious teen years
sorta led me to hanging out

00:02:26.625 --> 00:02:28.868
in tattoo shops at a young age...

00:02:28.868 --> 00:02:30.897
- How would you describe
your tattoo style?

00:02:30.897 --> 00:02:32.636
- Painterly illustrative.

00:02:32.636 --> 00:02:35.217
Floral is my concentration I would say.

00:02:35.217 --> 00:02:37.395
Flowers can represent a
lot of different things

00:02:37.395 --> 00:02:39.115
and be subtle at the same time,

00:02:39.115 --> 00:02:42.446
it's a classic timeless
piece to have a flower.

00:02:42.446 --> 00:02:45.835
- When Claire and I first
spoke, she wanted to work

00:02:45.835 --> 00:02:47.436
with you the most.
- Thank you.

00:02:47.436 --> 00:02:49.107
- Yeah, you're so talented.

00:02:49.107 --> 00:02:50.735
- Are you ready to see some designs?

00:02:50.735 --> 00:02:54.166
- Here are a few watercolors
that I came up with.

00:02:54.166 --> 00:02:55.673
- [Claire] I really like this middle one.

00:02:55.673 --> 00:02:56.506
- [Mallory] Okay, Yeah.

00:02:56.506 --> 00:02:58.108
I really love the colors on it.

00:02:58.108 --> 00:03:00.435
- [Claire] I think the
shape is nice and that...

00:03:00.435 --> 00:03:01.444
- Do you like the size?

00:03:01.444 --> 00:03:03.049
- Yeah, this is a great size.

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:05.020
- [Mallory] When I put
the stencil on you...

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:06.220
- [Claire] We can adjust it a little.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:07.480
- [Mallory] Adjust it if we need too.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:09.751
- That's the one, that's your
first tattoo right there.

00:03:09.751 --> 00:03:12.311
You happy with the design,
happy with the placement?

00:03:12.311 --> 00:03:13.311
- [Claire] Of course.

00:03:13.311 --> 00:03:15.220
- [Ben] That's a substantial
piece right there.

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:16.053
- [Claire] Yeah.

00:03:16.053 --> 00:03:17.511
- [Ben] I mean this is no joke.

00:03:17.511 --> 00:03:20.212
My first piece was the
size of a quarter, so.

00:03:20.212 --> 00:03:21.121
- I'm committed.

00:03:21.121 --> 00:03:22.340
- You're jumping right in.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.332
Are you ready to get your first ink?

00:03:24.332 --> 00:03:25.572
- Yes.

00:03:25.572 --> 00:03:26.489
- Let's go.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.286
- Ready?
Um hum.

00:03:30.286 --> 00:03:31.878
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:32.838
- I feel like it's not bad,

00:03:32.838 --> 00:03:35.805
but it definitely is
not comfortable either.

00:03:35.805 --> 00:03:38.336
It's like if you had a bad sunburn

00:03:38.336 --> 00:03:41.928
and someone just kept poking at it.

00:03:41.928 --> 00:03:43.306
- [Ben] It looks beautiful,

00:03:43.306 --> 00:03:44.878
how have you been coping with the pain?

00:03:44.878 --> 00:03:46.528
- [Claire] The first two and a half hours

00:03:46.528 --> 00:03:48.137
went by really quickly,

00:03:48.137 --> 00:03:50.139
now that it's getting more sensitive,

00:03:50.139 --> 00:03:51.427
it's a little bit harder.

00:03:51.427 --> 00:03:52.288
- [Ben] How's she doing Mallory?

00:03:52.288 --> 00:03:54.518
- She's sitting really
well, I'm impressed.

00:03:54.518 --> 00:03:55.675
- I'm kinda jealous right now.

00:03:55.675 --> 00:03:56.837
It's pretty addicting.

00:03:56.837 --> 00:03:58.766
Addicting, not in the negative sense.

00:03:58.766 --> 00:03:59.599
- [Mallory] Yeah.

00:03:59.599 --> 00:04:01.364
- In like once you do it,
you wanna do it again.

00:04:01.364 --> 00:04:02.801
- [Mallory] Yeah, I think
you get your first one,

00:04:02.801 --> 00:04:05.233
you realize that it
wasn't that big of a deal,

00:04:05.233 --> 00:04:07.482
you don't think about it that much.

00:04:07.482 --> 00:04:08.612
When somebody gets one tattoo,

00:04:08.612 --> 00:04:10.204
they really intend on getting others,

00:04:10.204 --> 00:04:12.553
even if they don't know it, you know.

00:04:12.553 --> 00:04:16.153
- [Ben] We're about four
and a half hours in.

00:04:16.153 --> 00:04:18.724
(dramatic instrumental music)

00:04:18.724 --> 00:04:21.604
- I wanted to report it
because this was a guy

00:04:21.604 --> 00:04:24.164
who was working with some
of my closest friends,

00:04:24.164 --> 00:04:27.511
and I was worried that he
would try to do the same thing

00:04:27.511 --> 00:04:30.623
he did to me to someone
else that I cared about.

00:04:30.623 --> 00:04:33.353
It was arranged that I was
going to have a phone call

00:04:33.353 --> 00:04:36.270
with the CEO to discuss the matter.

00:04:37.463 --> 00:04:40.884
I wasn't sure if the
company would be discreet.

00:04:40.884 --> 00:04:43.193
I wasn't sure if they would believe me.

00:04:43.193 --> 00:04:46.169
I was scared of what my coworkers

00:04:46.169 --> 00:04:48.278
would think of me if it got out.

00:04:48.278 --> 00:04:51.865
I ended up texting my friend
who lives in San Diego.

00:04:51.865 --> 00:04:54.198
He, in the middle of the night drove up,

00:04:54.198 --> 00:04:57.246
said, I want to be with
you during that call.

00:04:57.246 --> 00:05:01.329
The next day my friend
calls me up, and she says,

00:05:02.979 --> 00:05:07.009
"Oh my gosh, our boss just got fired",

00:05:07.009 --> 00:05:11.176
and I was so happy in that moment.

00:05:12.586 --> 00:05:15.258
I had my friend who
drove up from San Diego

00:05:15.258 --> 00:05:18.367
and the friend who gave me the
phone call pick out flowers,

00:05:18.367 --> 00:05:20.117
lavender and poppy.

00:05:20.117 --> 00:05:22.146
My experience was painful,

00:05:22.146 --> 00:05:23.807
this tattoo's a little painful,

00:05:23.807 --> 00:05:26.146
but you can find beautiful things in it.

00:05:26.146 --> 00:05:27.967
- And stuff to help some,

00:05:27.967 --> 00:05:31.117
and empower some women
to reclaim their bodies

00:05:31.117 --> 00:05:33.026
through the process of getting tattooed,

00:05:33.026 --> 00:05:35.666
and it makes it even more rewarding.

00:05:35.666 --> 00:05:37.954
- How close are we, Mallory?

00:05:37.954 --> 00:05:40.306
- Let me just clean it, and we're done.

00:05:40.306 --> 00:05:41.397
- We're done!

00:05:41.397 --> 00:05:45.458
You have successfully
completed your first tattoo.

00:05:45.458 --> 00:05:47.938
- I'm really excited to
see the final results.

00:05:47.938 --> 00:05:51.284
- Okay, do you wanna check it out?

00:05:51.284 --> 00:05:52.444
- Oh my gosh.

00:05:52.444 --> 00:05:53.346
- [Mallory] You like it?

00:05:53.346 --> 00:05:56.784
- I love it, I feel like
I'm in shock a little bit.

00:05:56.784 --> 00:05:59.695
I couldn't have gotten a
better first tattoo then this.

00:05:59.695 --> 00:06:01.986
I'm so obsessed with it already.

00:06:01.986 --> 00:06:03.106
- How do you think your friends

00:06:03.106 --> 00:06:05.744
and family will react
to this new addition?

00:06:05.744 --> 00:06:07.666
- My friends are really gonna to like it.

00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:11.014
My family, they're going
to be surprised at least.

00:06:11.014 --> 00:06:11.991
- Are you gonna tell them?

00:06:11.991 --> 00:06:14.426
- Yeah, 'cause I don't wanna
have to hide it all my life.

00:06:14.426 --> 00:06:16.844
- Is one of your friends here, who...

00:06:16.844 --> 00:06:17.677
- Yeah.

00:06:17.677 --> 00:06:19.986
- Is one of the flowers?

00:06:19.986 --> 00:06:21.676
- I love you.
I love you.

00:06:21.676 --> 00:06:23.055
- [Ben] How do you think
the tattoo came out?

00:06:23.055 --> 00:06:24.506
- I think it's beautiful.

00:06:24.506 --> 00:06:27.175
I think it's everything
I expected and more.

00:06:27.175 --> 00:06:29.956
- [Claire] She has lavender
on her ankle as well,

00:06:29.956 --> 00:06:31.916
so we're gonna match a little bit.

00:06:31.916 --> 00:06:33.556
- [Ben] Oh check you guys out, twins.

00:06:33.556 --> 00:06:36.904
- [Claire] So, I hope
that anyone watching this,

00:06:36.904 --> 00:06:39.866
who's going through a similar situation,

00:06:39.866 --> 00:06:41.996
knows that people will have their back

00:06:41.996 --> 00:06:44.246
and they can speak out too.

00:06:45.446 --> 00:06:48.446
♪ See you sometime ♪

00:06:49.695 --> 00:06:52.389
♪ See you someday ♪

00:06:52.389 --> 00:06:54.471
♪ Faraway ♪

00:06:54.471 --> 00:06:57.829
- But no, I feel a little bit
like Santa Claus right now.

00:06:57.829 --> 00:07:01.132
Yeah, I feel a little bit like
tattoo Santa Claus right now.

00:07:01.132 --> 00:07:02.583
Tattoo Santa Claus.

00:07:02.583 --> 00:07:04.239
- Yeah, tattoo Santa Claus.
(Claire and Ben laughing)

